{{-
# The rights page (rights-design.md section 9), written only when the model has named rights, so a project without them gets no file:
# each named right, what it says, why, and the lifecycles that use it.
include "_docs.scriban"
if model.rights.size > 0
  capture content
-}}
{{ banner "<!--" }} -->

# Rights

Named rights: each one is stated once, and every lifecycle that uses it says in which of its states it holds.
{{- for r in model.rights }}

## {{ md_cell r.display_name }}
{{- if r.description }}

{{ r.description }}
{{- end }}

| | |
| --- | --- |
| Name | {{ md_code r.name }} |
| Allows or denies | {{ r.access == "deny" ? "denies" : "allows" }} |
| Who | {{ right_who(r, "") }} |
{{- if r.except.size > 0 }}
| Except | {{ actor_links(r.except, "") }} |
{{- end }}
| Does | {{ right_does(r) }} |
{{- if r.attributes.size > 0 }}
| Attributes | {{ right_attributes(r) }} |
{{- end }}
{{- if r.while_frozen }}
| While frozen | holds only while the object{{ r.ends.size > 0 ? ", or the link," : "" }} is frozen |
{{- end }}
{{- if r.condition_text }}
| When | {{ md_code r.condition_text }} |
{{- end }}
{{- where = [] }}{{ for u in r.uses }}{{ where[where.size] = process_link(u.process, "") + (u.states.size == 0 ? " (all states)" : " in " + code_paths(u.states)) }}{{ end }}
| Used by | {{ where.size == 0 ? "no lifecycle yet" : (where | array.join ", ") }} |
{{- end }}
{{ end -}}
{{-
  file "rights.md" content
end
-}}
